This repository holds a Model Derivative of Gemma: a full fine-tune of google/functiongemma-270m-it
(revision 39eccb091651513a5dfb56892d3714c1b5b8276c).

Modified files: model.safetensors (the weights, changed by the fine-tune), config.json and
generation_config.json (written by the fine-tune), and the GGUF files (converted from the fine-tuned
weights). The tokenizer files and chat_template.jinja are those of the base model, unchanged.
tools.json and quick-start.ipynb are new files of this project.

